{"strongs": "H0577", "word": "אָֽנָּ֫א", "translit": "an.na", "root": "אמן", "morph": "H:Intj", "pos": "interjection", "gloss": "ah, now!", "definition": "אָֽנָּ֫א interjection (from אָהּ and נָא , q. v.) a strong particle of entreaty, ah, now! I (or We ) beseech thee! often followed by an imperative; Gen 50:17 (to Joseph) ׳ אָנָּא שָׂא נָא וג Ah, now ! forgive, we pray, etc., Exod 32:31 (to God); elsewhere always followed by ׳ י or אֲדֹנָי Ps 118:25 (twice in verse); Neh 1:5 ; Neh 1:11 ; Dan 9:4 . Written אָֽנָּ֫ה 2Kgs 20:3 (= Isa 38:3 ) Jonah 1:14 ; Jonah 4:2 ; Ps 116:4 ; Ps 116:16 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB573')\">BDB573</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H577')\">H577</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB572')\">BDB572</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB574')\">BDB574</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אָֽנָּ֫א</bdbheb> <b>interjection</b> (from <bdbheb>אָהּ</bdbheb> and  <bdbheb><reflink>נָא</reflink></bdbheb>, q. v.) a strong particle of entreaty, <highlightword>ah, now!</highlightword> I (or <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup>) beseech thee! often followed by an imperative; <ref ref=\"Gen 50:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,50,17)\">Gen 50:17</ref> (to Joseph) <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אָנָּא שָׂא נָא וג</bdbheb> <highlight>Ah, now !</highlight> forgive, we pray, etc., <ref ref=\"Exod 32:31\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,31)\">Exod 32:31</ref> (to God); elsewhere always followed by <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> or <bdbheb>אֲדֹנָי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 118:25\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"118\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"118\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(19,118,25)\">Ps 118:25</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Neh 1:5\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(16,1,5)\">Neh 1:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 1:11\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=